---
const layers = [
  "UI",
  "BLoC",
  "Use Case",
  "Repository",
  "NetworkGuard",
  "Remote Data Source",
  "API",
];
---

<figure class="failure-figure">
  <ol class="flow">
    {layers.map((layer) => (
      <li>{layer}</li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <figcaption>
    Failure propagation: Either&lt;Failure, T&gt; carries explicit failure
    results. FailureMapper translates where needed; existing Failure instances
    retain their meaning.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
